parameters.text:
=Evaluate the following B2B inbound lead against our Ideal Customer Profile (B2B SaaS, Mid-Market/Enterprise, or Technical Operations teams).

Lead Name: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.fullName }}
Email: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.workEmail }}
Company: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.companyName }}
Domain: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.companyDomain }}
Inquiry Message: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.inquiryMessage }}
Website Snippet: {{ ($json.data || '').toString().replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').slice(0, 1500) }}

Return a structured qualification assessment with a numeric score (0-100), tier (Hot, Warm, or Cold), concise company summary, qualification reasoning, and a personalized 2-sentence outreach icebreaker.

parameters.inputSchema:
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "leadScore": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "ICP fit and buying intent score from 0 to 100"
    },
    "qualificationTier": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "Hot",
        "Warm",
        "Cold"
      ]
    },
    "companySummary": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "One-sentence summary of what the prospect company does"
    },
    "qualificationReason": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Key reason behind the assigned score"
    },
    "personalizedIcebreaker": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Tailored 2-sentence sales opener referencing their business and inquiry"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "leadScore",
    "qualificationTier",
    "companySummary",
    "qualificationReason",
    "personalizedIcebreaker"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}
